        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Canaropa JNF-FP227-120-630, Satin Stainless Steel Oblong Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by JNF in Portugal, the 4-11/16 Inch Oblong Flush Pull features a satin stainless steel finish. The modern material is softened by the traditional shape, making this pocket door handle a great compromise for people who like the easy-to-maintain look of stainless steel without the sharp corners that some contemporary hardware has. Comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<center><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CAN-227-dimentions.gif?v=1704354684\" width=\"577\" height=\"114\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Canaropa JNF-227 Stainless Steel Flush Pull Dimensions\"></center>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Oblong Pocket Door Pull with Satin Stainless Steel Finish:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: <b>Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Length: 4-11/16\" (120 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-19/32\" (40 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 19/32\" (16 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\" (2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 17/32\" (14 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Opening Length: 3-1/2\" (89 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Opening Width: 1\" (25 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Cutout Opening Length: 3-3/8\" (85 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Cutout Opening Width: 7/8\" (23 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with all necessary mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
